          "start": 0
        },
        "quote": "The following criteria must be met for two individuals to be considered domestic partners for the purposes of registering the partnership with the City of Topeka:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.50.020:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.50.020 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "63d161ec-a09b-5275-9eb7-473c8fa298e5",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 249,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.50.020:block:1",
          "start": 163
        },
        "quote": "(a) Both individuals are residents of the City of Topeka, as defined in TMC 2.50.010 .",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.50.020:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.50.020 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "ce92d5e7-46cb-5080-8c84-480f9f82c01f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 417,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.50.020:block:2",
          "start": 250
        },
        "quote": "(b) Both individuals share a common permanent residence. It is not necessary that the legal right to possess the common residence be in both of the individual’s names.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.50.020:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.50.020 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "37ba8c10-9f4e-519a-b799-7f5f2a842ad1",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 495,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.50.020:block:3",
          "start": 418
        },
        "quote": "(c) Both individuals agree to be in a relationship of mutual interdependence.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.50.020:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.50.020 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "e28f3f8a-d399-5f0b-9179-a61d92d46c79",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 649,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.50.020:block:4",
          "start": 496
        },
        "quote": "(d) Both individuals contribute to the maintenance and support of the household. The individuals are not required to contribute equally to the household.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.50.020:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.50.020 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "43f73173-e887-5c0c-b69e-f40d1a02657f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 768,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.50.020:block:5",
          "start": 650
        },
        "quote": "(e) Neither individual is married to a third individual or a member of a domestic partnership with a third individual.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.50.020:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.50.020 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "a03f950a-990a-51d4-a84b-58baf95b26a7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 817,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.50.020:block:6",
          "start": 769
        },
        "quote": "(f) Each individual is 18 years of age or older.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.50.020:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.50.020 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "97ba0da0-8a61-55b0-be18-16df42ebbf51",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 874,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.50.020:block:7",
          "start": 818
        },
        "quote": "(g) Each individual has the mental capacity to contract.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.50.020:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.50.020 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "c743192a-06b7-5592-8368-1f0b54e19fda",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1014,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.50.020:block:8",
          "start": 875
        },
        "quote": "(h) The two individuals are not related by blood in a way that would prevent them from being married to one another in the State of Kansas.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.50.020:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.50.020 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "bbc1e667-decc-5c59-a95f-55f0f27ea703",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1200,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.50.020:block:9",
          "start": 1015
        },
        "quote": "(i) Both individuals agree to file a declaration of domestic partnership with the City pursuant to this chapter. (Ord. 20206 § 14, 9-10-19; Ord. 19905 § 2, 5-20-14. Formerly 2.150.020.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.50.020:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
